<%# The tray: the items a host puts in the corner (`chats_dock { … }`, or
    `chats_tray { … }` on its own), left to right in the block's order,
    between the dock's windows and its panel. Each item is a
    `chats_tray_item`; the chats--tray controller (tray_controller.js) runs
    them all: one open at a time, the phone sheet, Escape, memory, badges.

    Locals: tray (the items' HTML), owner (whose memory: the viewer's key,
    or "guest"), standalone (true when there is no dock around it). %>
<% standalone = local_assigns.fetch(:standalone, false) %>
<%= tag.div tray,
      class: "chats-tray",
      data: {
        controller: "chats--tray",
        "chats--dock-target": ("tray" unless standalone),
        "chats--tray-owner-value": owner,
        "chats--tray-standalone-value": standalone,
        action: "keydown->chats--tray#keydown " \
                "turbo:load@document->chats--tray#pageChanged turbo:render@document->chats--tray#pageChanged " \
                "turbo:frame-load@document->chats--tray#frameLoaded"
      } %>
